# Set api_token to the configured CASHIER_API_TOKEN in your REST client.
@server = http://localhost:3000

### Accounts
GET {{server}}/?query=SELECT%20account%20FROM%20%23accounts%20WHERE%20close%20IS%20NULL
Authorization: Bearer {{api_token}}

### Payees
GET {{server}}/?query=SELECT%20DISTINCT%20COALESCE(payee,%20narration)%20AS%20payee%20FROM%20transactions%20ORDER%20BY%20payee
Authorization: Bearer {{api_token}}

### Reload
GET {{server}}/reload
Authorization: Bearer {{api_token}}

### Ping
GET {{server}}/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{api_token}}

### Health (no token required)
GET {{server}}/health
